        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                "word": "quantique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ca1a37a1-7de3-4d53-b750-6354661a7d6e",
                        "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "quantiques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "364472fd-54fd-39a0-91f3-a220a3314743",
                        "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif aux théories des quanta."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "physical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b995ceb5-2321-497e-b176-5d8d8733e7de",
                                "sense_id": "364472fd-54fd-39a0-91f3-a220a3314743",
                                "text": "Le chercheur a été récompensé, au côté de l’Américain John Clauser et de l’Autrichien Anton Zeilinger, pour ses découvertes sur l’intrication quantique. Il s'agit d’un phénomène où deux particules restent corrélées, quelle que soit la distance qui les sépare."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b55b5ad0-095d-4ca8-b2d8-969221729b1f",
                                "sense_id": "364472fd-54fd-39a0-91f3-a220a3314743",
                                "text": "Elle en conclut que \"la demande de conseil et d’accompagnement pour la problématique de la menace quantique, est à ce jour très faible\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1304a7ee-c1a8-3661-b6c2-bf35531f5775",
                        "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui passe brutalement d’une valeur à une autre, sans valeurs intermédiaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "834b4530-2b8d-363c-aadf-f960774eb519",
                        "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est à deux endroits à la fois (par référence à l’expérience de Schrödinger)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9e1cf94-27cc-414c-b6fb-4ef8706ddaa8",
                                "sense_id": "834b4530-2b8d-363c-aadf-f960774eb519",
                                "text": "Face à cette débauche d’énergie ridicule, le globe-trotteur ­d’appartement a inauguré une nouvelle forme de voyage quantique lui permettant d’être à la fois là et ailleurs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6dcb199-f907-30c8-9348-86d9c6d9d21e",
                        "entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Terme nébuleux associé à la mouvance New Age utilisé pour moderniser et donner du crédit à tout concept pseudoscientifique ayant trait à la spiritualité, à l’ésotérisme, en profitant de la notoriété et du principe d’incertitude de la physique quantique pour justifier des notions non empiriques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Usage critiqué",
                            "Pseudo-sciences"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "290ac8d9-556b-4026-bb0f-b47627cb0b33",
                                "sense_id": "b6dcb199-f907-30c8-9348-86d9c6d9d21e",
                                "text": "Je ne fais pas des guérisseurs des êtres scientifiques, mais je démontre, en m’appuyant sur des études, des scientifiques, la médecine chinoise et quantique, qu’ils sont l’itinéraire bis de la médecine. Nous sommes le trait d’union entre l’homéopathie et la médecine traditionnelle (l’allopathie)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e8cdb35-3a28-478f-9d13-98f31faee429",
                                "sense_id": "b6dcb199-f907-30c8-9348-86d9c6d9d21e",
                                "text": "S’agissant de la « médecine quantique », je dois avouer n’en avoir trouvé aucune définition en bonne et due forme — une carence qui en dit déjà long sur l’embarras inavoué de ses promoteurs —, seulement une multitude d’affirmations bavardes et filandreuses ne prenant appui sur aucun fait observé et énonçant des objectifs creux pour ne pas dire vides."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba9a7fff-20f4-4b5e-a328-1058a98b5fa8",
                        "source_entry_id": "76e2dcc0-8d0d-3aee-a6c7-b905e5dc47af",
                        "target_lang_word": "quantum",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quantum",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b85e08c4-266f-3708-a2ab-5248758f6e23",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The total amount of something; quantity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Asia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd0c39f4-c53d-4253-b825-561f86ba4553",
                                                "sense_id": "b85e08c4-266f-3708-a2ab-5248758f6e23",
                                                "text": "The reader will perhaps be curious to know the quantum of this present, but we cannot satisfy his curiosity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49d3ce52-3c8f-484f-8957-b0c32295fe32",
                                                "sense_id": "b85e08c4-266f-3708-a2ab-5248758f6e23",
                                                "text": "A certain quantum of power must always exist in the community, in some hands, and under some appellation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1950a300-ea0d-45b8-9a09-06d8e4eeff41",
                                                "sense_id": "b85e08c4-266f-3708-a2ab-5248758f6e23",
                                                "text": "Otherwise I will have given the lie to my maxim that whether you work eight or twenty hours, the quantum of work that gets done on a normal day is the same."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fa3224d-e55e-483c-8fec-b13ab52f068e",
                                                "sense_id": "b85e08c4-266f-3708-a2ab-5248758f6e23",
                                                "text": "The Congress's core ministerial panel on Friday gave its green signal to raising motor fuel prices but the quantum of increase emerged as a hitch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0889310e-c6f6-3a37-970b-d3899e9f32f2",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The total amount of something; quantity.",
                                            "The amount of compensation awarded to a successful party in a lawsuit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Asia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81528851-57c6-32ca-b0eb-714f633c67ea",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The total amount of something; quantity.",
                                            "The length or magnitude of the sentence handed down to someone who has been found guilty of a crime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Asia",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a23dfb8-bcc9-38a2-905a-47d6311eed94",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount or quantity observably present, or available."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ae7cd05-03f2-4d63-b023-f7ab84bf4bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "4a23dfb8-bcc9-38a2-905a-47d6311eed94",
                                                "text": "Each man has only a quantum of compassion, he argued, and mine is used up for the day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ff856b-36a7-4226-967f-59ceb9aa151a",
                                                "sense_id": "4a23dfb8-bcc9-38a2-905a-47d6311eed94",
                                                "text": "The dream of flying, according to Strümpell, is the appropriate image used by the psyche to interpret the quantum of stimulus [translating Reizquantum] proceeding from the rise and fall of the lungs when the cutaneous sensation of the thorax has simultaneously sunk into unconsciousness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3fbf4ab-7139-3b51-acb8-23a3f2a63954",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The smallest possible, and therefore indivisible, unit of a given quantity or quantifiable phenomenon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5170c737-4a0a-45af-aba9-08c2f006e43b",
                                                "sense_id": "e3fbf4ab-7139-3b51-acb8-23a3f2a63954",
                                                "text": "The quantum of light energy was later called a photon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a70e19ce-8456-3d82-aa99-051b6f3fff84",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount of time allocated for a thread to perform its work in a multithreaded environment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78017179-88eb-3d5c-b5a9-40c3dd92ce9f",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of quantum computing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41760f6f-c036-4dda-a971-26af70140261",
                                                "sense_id": "78017179-88eb-3d5c-b5a9-40c3dd92ce9f",
                                                "text": "Developing for quantum has never been more accessible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "771d3078-1d74-3cb1-a756-03893114b4f2",
                                        "entry_id": "982782a7-d9fb-3438-a373-2324187bbb91",
                                        "glosses": [
